Provenance
----------

The mark is a photograph of an original paper-craft parrot. It is generated, not
hand-edited: `tools/build_app_icon.py` crops the craft, lifts its paper
background and sets it inside the badge, emitting the favicon, the large mark
and the Windows icon from that one photograph. `--check` fails if any of them
drifts. Each generated file carries the source URL and this rights statement in
its metadata, and only the large mark carries a visible watermark — at favicon
size a watermark is unreadable and protects nothing.

The parrot sits inside the pentagon badge the dashboard header has always used.
A parrot repeats what it has heard; Joblooper repeats only wording its user has
approved.

Contact the owner through the repository above for permission requests.
